{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero: 2 character has been unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels and Modes: The normal mode is open. There are 3 levels of difficulty in the normal mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics: 15 types of relics are open</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment sets: The demo version has opened up 6 equipment sets, totaling 85 types of equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Enchantment: Open 7 types of enchantment entries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters: 50 monster images, but there are 135 randomly generated different monsters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full game content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes: The official version will feature 7 characters, each with their own exclusive set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels and Modes: The normal mode of the levels will have 5 levels of difficulty, and an infinite mode will also be available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics: There will be 40 types of relics in the end, and the relic enhancement function will be unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment sets: There are 12 sets, and ultimately over 160 types of equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Enchantment: There are ultimately 10 enchantment entries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters: 50 monster images, with 270 randomly generated different monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment collection system: An achievement system for item collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do a group of believers who have sold their souls gradually complete the game of the evil god in the abyss? Use the items from the abyss to complete the challenge and redeem yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027140/extras/792b5